WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Start in General Business Overview. Track sample website visits against a monthly target.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
In Marketing, see which campaigns spend the most and which ad types report conversions.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.000
Return on spend compares reported conversion value per dollar across campaigns.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
A higher return is a reason to investigate, not proof the ads caused more sales.

00:24.000 --> 00:31.000
Turn the finding into a decision: test a small budget shift without raising total spend.

00:31.000 --> 00:38.000
Keep a similar market unchanged so you have a comparison.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.000
Set a four-week review. Check store orders and net sales after ad costs.

00:45.000 --> 00:51.750
In Decisionate, record the outcome and what you learned when the test ends.
